Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (DC&nbsp;11)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;11)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Suffers <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Checks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Checks\">Ability Checks</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>Items:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Basic_Poison\" title=\"Basic Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Basic_Poison\" title=\"Basic Poison\">Basic Poison</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisonous_Slime_Bomb\" title=\"Poisonous Slime Bomb\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Poisonous_Slime_Bomb\" title=\"Poisonous Slime Bomb\">Poisonous Slime Bomb</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<p>Spells and actions:\n</p>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r347748\"><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Mist\" title=\"Poison Mist\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Poison_Mist_Icon.webp/30px-Poison_Mist_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Poison_Mist_Icon.webp/45px-Poison_Mist_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Poison_Mist_Icon.webp/60px-Poison_Mist_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison Mist\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Poison_Mist_Icon.webp/30px-Poison_Mist_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Poison_Mist_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Mist\" title=\"Poison Mist\">Poison Mist</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Venomous_Discharge_(Addled_Frog)\" title=\"Venomous Discharge (Addled Frog)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Venomous_Discharge_Addled_Frog_Icon.webp/30px-Venomous_Discharge_Addled_Frog_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Venomous_Discharge_Addled_Frog_Icon.webp/45px-Venomous_Discharge_Addled_Frog_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Venomous_Discharge_Addled_Frog_Icon.webp/60px-Venomous_Discharge_Addled_Frog_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Venomous Discharge (Addled Frog)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Venomous_Discharge_Addled_Frog_Icon.webp/30px-Venomous_Discharge_Addled_Frog_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Venomous_Discharge_Addled_Frog_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Venomous_Discharge_(Addled_Frog)\" title=\"Venomous Discharge (Addled Frog)\">Venomous Discharge (Addled Frog)</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Poisoned condition from this source loses duration at the beginning of the turn, which together with duration 1 means that poisoned enemies are longer poisoned during their turn.</li>\n<li>The DC depends on the source:\n<ul><li>For <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Basic_Poison\" title=\"Basic Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Basic_Poison\" title=\"Basic Poison\">Basic Poison</a> it is 11.</li>\n<li>For <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisonous_Slime_Bomb\" title=\"Poisonous Slime Bomb\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/GRN_Poisonous_Slime_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisonous_Slime_Bomb\" title=\"Poisonous Slime Bomb\">Poisonous Slime Bomb</a> it's the DC of the player character.</li>\n<li>If the cloud was created by a <a href=\"/wiki/NPC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"NPC\">character</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a> to save against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\">Poisoned</a> becomes 8 + <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">Proficiency Bonus</a> + <a href=\"/wiki/Spellcasting_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spellcasting Modifier\">Spellcasting Modifier</a> of the creator.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Needs verification.\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200148\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.091 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.098 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3456/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38143/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10592/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function c